    "path": "/home/enpasos/projects/skillpilot/curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-evidence/2026-10-14/chemie-acid-base-seven-positive-profile-author-shapes-technical-20261014-v1/inputs/fourteen-full-cases.bound.exact.json",
